{"availability":"available","full":"shifat100/daily-gk","name":"daily-gk","description":"Daily general knowledge questions in Bangla, stored in a custom .mcq format for easy use and integration. Perfect for quiz apps, learning tools, or personal practice.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":4,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-27T04:06:17Z","updated":"2026-10-01T05:15:38Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://shifat100.github.io/daily-gk/","topics":["android","bangla-dataset","bangla-language-processing","bangla-project","bangladesh","cakurir-prostuti","daily-gk","general-knowledge","general-knowledge-daily","j2me","java","job-circular","kaios","linux","sadharon-ggyan","webapp","windows"],"demo":"https://shifat100.github.io/daily-gk/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:19.043Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:19.043Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:19.043Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:07:15.812Z","stars":4,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:12:19.043Z","stars":4,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A modern, ultra-fast, zero-dependency Progressive Web Application (PWA) designed with Android Material Design 3 (MD3) for practicing General Knowledge (GK) and preparing for competitive exams.","Daily GK is a lightweight, serverless educational web platform that allows users to practice thousands of multiple-choice questions (MCQs) covering General Science, Geography, History, Information Technology, and Current Affairs.","Built with pure Vanilla HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, it runs completely client-side right inside any modern web browser—no installation, backend server, or build step required."],"features":["Quiz Mode: Interactive MCQ practice with immediate visual feedback (Correct/Wrong) and detailed expandable explanations.","Study Mode: Read and review questions directly with pre-highlighted correct answers and explanation cards.","Exam Mode: Simulates real-world test environments with a live countdown timer, answer selection state, and an automated scorecard (Correct, Wrong, and Skipped counts) upon submission.","🔊 Text-to-Speech (TTS): Built-in native speech synthesis that reads out questions and options aloud.","📑 Bookmarks / Saved Questions: Save important questions locally with one click; filter saved lists, or Export/Download them as a .txt file for offline study."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shifat100/daily-gk/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"888a3b7534d16288a1720f399a25823e55330e341a0ca4f582cf4bbb38322ca6","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:15.913Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:15.913Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A modern, ultra-fast, zero-dependency Progressive Web Application (PWA) designed with Android Material Design 3 (MD3) for practicing General Knowledge (GK) and preparing for competitive exams.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shifat100/daily-gk/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"888a3b7534d16288a1720f399a25823e55330e341a0ca4f582cf4bbb38322ca6","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shifat100/daily-gk/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:15.913Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T05:15:38Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shifat100/daily-gk/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:15.913Z","hash":"888a3b7534d16288a1720f399a25823e55330e341a0ca4f582cf4bbb38322ca6","originalBytes":5978,"storedBytes":5978,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["feature","web","pwa","questions","android","daily","git","license","live","native","version","app","application","bash","browser","correct","index.html","j2me","locally","material","mcq","mode","navigation","open","options","practice","project","question","any","apk","bank","branch","built-in","buttons","client-side","clone","code","commit","competitive","completely","daily-gk","data","demo","desktop","developer","directly","downloa